<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it attributes a declaration (linguistic object) about a constraint to the agent responsible for it. The original property has domain prov:Entity and range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range crm:E39_Actor (also prov:Agent)."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "was attributed to"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS attribuisce una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) relativa a una costrizione all'agente che ne è responsabile. La proprietà originale ha come domain prov:Entity e come range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range crm:E39_Actor (anche prov:Agent)."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è stato attribuito a"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> .
